     "body": "<p>Fixed by updating these predicates in oaiprovider/branches/maintenance-1.1.  OAIProvider 1.1.1 has been released with this change.  Note that 1.1.1 it is not backward-compatible with Fedora 2.2.3 &#8211; it only works with Fedora 2.2.4.</p>\n\n<p>Download OAIProvider 1.1.1 here:<br/>\n  <a href=\"http://downloads.sourceforge.net/fedora-commons/oaiprovider-1.1.1.zip\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://downloads.sourceforge.net/fedora-commons/oaiprovider-1.1.1.zip</a></p>\n\n<p>Source distribution:<br/>\n  <a href=\"http://downloads.sourceforge.net/fedora-commons/oaiprovider-1.1.1-src.zip\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://downloads.sourceforge.net/fedora-commons/oaiprovider-1.1.1-src.zip</a></p>\n\n<p>To upgrade from OAIProvider 1.1:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>make a copy of your original WEB-INF/classes/proai.properties file</li>\n\t<li>install the new web app in place of the old one</li>\n\t<li>copy your old proai.properties back into WEB-INF/classes/</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "09/Mar/09 2:53 PM",
